rtion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}class} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SatisfactionClass}_S(S,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\exists\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_M\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S(S,M,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\Sigma)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}satisfaction\\text{-}class} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{SatisfactionClass}_S(S,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\exists\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_M\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S(S,M,\\operatorname{Val}_M,\\Sigma)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 是某个集合结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 的公式—赋值满足关系；原先无来源的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TarskiRecursive}\">\\(\\operatorname{TarskiRecursive}\\)</span> 已展开为上游的四参数递归满足关系。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"1cb489a34bc2433c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"1cb489a34bc2433c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelation}_S\\subseteq V^4$（参数顺序为“满足关系、结构、项求值、签名”，see [[../batch06/58-df-zfc-logic-satisfaction-relation.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,M,\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Val}_M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLogicSatisfactionRelatio